      "text": "A people's relation with the state should rest on a bilateral pact that the state cannot change unilaterally.",
      "value": 2,
      "rationale": "The PNV seeks a new status guaranteed by bilaterality, modelled on the Concierto, to shield Basque self-government from unilateral State decisions.",
      "sources": [
